# Lecture 10

### SVG Icons

---

## Iconify Integration

- Icons from the Iconify collection
- Specified via FrontMatter
- Monochrome icons support custom colours
- Replace image files on cards

---

## Usage

Use FrontMatter in the resource markdown file:

```yaml
---
icon:
  type: vscode-icons:file-type-pdf2
---
```

---

## Summary

SVG icons from Iconify provide a flexible alternative to image files for card presentation.
